stream
BT
/F1 15 Tf
50 748 Td
18 TL
(ADDENDUM - CURRENT TRANSPORT PRICING POLICY) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
14 TL
T*
(Kwik-Parsel / Gohezoh Integrated Services) Tj
T*
(Effective specification update: 2026-10-13) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This addendum supersedes the driver-transport customer-price formula in the) Tj
T*
(corrective specification, including the eligible direct cost / 0.75 formula and) Tj
T*
(the 25% contribution example. It does not change warehouse fee policy.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(PARTNER-SIDE TRANSPORT FEE) Tj
T*
(For each eligible driver, rider, or transport-partner delivery leg, Gohezo) Tj
T*
(retains 20% of that leg's accepted and collected charge from the partner) Tj
T*
(settlement. The partner sets its customer-facing bid knowing this deduction.) Tj
T*
(The customer is shown the accepted quote; no separate 20% platform fee is) Tj
T*
(added to the customer price.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Example: on an accepted and collected NGN 100,000 leg, the platform fee is) Tj
T*
(NGN 20,000 and partner net payable is NGN 80,000 before separately agreed) Tj
T*
(adjustments. Show the gross charge, fee, adjustments, and net payable to the) Tj
T*
(partner before award acceptance and in settlement history.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Apply the fee once per eligible completed transport leg, not repeatedly to the) Tj
T*
(whole-job amount. Do not accrue it on an unaccepted quote, an unperformed or) Tj
T*
(cancelled leg, or an uncollected amount. Preserve refunds and corrections as) Tj
T*
(linked ledger adjustments. Multiple legs use each leg's own accepted amount.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Do not stack the former / 0.75 pricing formula on this fee. Any separately) Tj
T*
(applicable service charge must be disclosed in the quote and accepted before) Tj
T*
(commitment. This platform fee is separate from BDO/marketer commissions and) Tj
T*
(from warehouse, packaging, and other approved service fees.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(IMPLEMENTATION NOTE) Tj
T*
(This is a business-policy update. Update and test quote, award, fee-ledger,) Tj
T*
(refund, and partner-settlement behavior before enabling it for live awards.) Tj
T*
(The ordered core logistics scope and acceptance criteria are in) Tj
T*
(docs/RENOVATION_SPEC.md and docs/CORE_FEATURES.md.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
